TEXT(beginproblem());
$showPartialCorrectAnswers = 0;
$prompt = <<'PROMPT_ED2A_9397';
<p>ed2a_9397</p> <h4>Three-Point Test Cross Problem</h4><p>A test cross is a way to explore the relationship between genes and their respective alleles. It is a useful tool for genetic mapping and deciphering the inheritance of traits. Specifically, a three-point test cross examines three (3) genes at the same time to learn about their assortment in gamete formation.</p><p>A standard three-point test cross involves crossing a heterozygous organism for all three genes with an organism that is homozygous recessive for all three genes</p> <p>For this problem, a test cross using a fruit fly (<i>Drosophila melanogaster</i>) heterozygous for three genes was conducted to understand their genetic interactions.</p><h6>Characteristics of Recessive Phenotypes</h6><p><ul><li><strong><span style="color: #58651d;">Gene B</span></strong> is linked with the '<span style="color: #58651d;"><i>bumpy</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #58651d;">Gene B</span> has a skin texture that is not smooth, but rough with small bumps all over.</li> <li><strong><span style="color: #0e6a75;">Gene J</span></strong> is affiliated with the '<span style="color: #0e6a75;"><i>jerky</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #0e6a75;">Gene J</span> moves in rapid and sudden movements, displaying an unpredictable flight pattern.</li> <li><strong><span style="color: #9f2d4d;">Gene N</span></strong> is associated with the '<span style="color: #9f2d4d;"><i>nerdy</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #9f2d4d;">Gene N</span> has large, prominent eyes that stand out, much like thick-rimmed glasses.</li> </ul></p><table style="border-collapse: collapse; border: 2px solid black;"><tr><th align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Phenotype</span></th><th colspan="3" align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Genotypes</span></th><th align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Progeny<br/>Count</span></th></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">bumpy, jerky, nerdy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #e4f1c3; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">b</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cbf2fd; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">j</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe2e4; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">n</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">1,632</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">bumpy, jerky</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #e4f1c3; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">b</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cbf2fd; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">j</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #9f2d4d;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">140</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">bumpy, nerdy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #e4f1c3; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">b</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #0e6a75;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe2e4; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">n</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">704</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">bumpy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #e4f1c3; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">b</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #0e6a75;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #9f2d4d;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">44</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">jerky, nerdy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #58651d;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cbf2fd; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">j</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe2e4; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">n</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">31</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">jerky</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #58651d;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cbf2fd; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">j</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #9f2d4d;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">721</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">nerdy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #58651d;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #0e6a75;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe2e4; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">n</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">135</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;"><i>wildtype</i></span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #58651d;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #0e6a75;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #9f2d4d;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">1,593</span></td></tr><tr><th colspan="4" align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">TOTAL =</span></th><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">5,000</span></td></tr></table><p>The resulting phenotypes are summarized in the table above.</p> <h6>Question</h6> <p>Based on the traits expressed in the offspring, identify the <span style="color: DarkBlue;"><strong>all recombinant genotypes</strong></span> for genes <b>J</b> and <b>B</b>. These genotypes result from crossover events that occur between the two genes <b>J</b> and <b>B</b> during meiosis.</p> <p>More than one genotype will be correct. Select all that apply.</p>
PROMPT_ED2A_9397
loadMacros('parserCheckboxList.pl');
$choice_1 = <<'LITERAL_ED2A_9397_CHOICE_1';
bjn
LITERAL_ED2A_9397_CHOICE_1
$choice_2 = <<'LITERAL_ED2A_9397_CHOICE_2';
bj+
LITERAL_ED2A_9397_CHOICE_2
$choice_3 = <<'LITERAL_ED2A_9397_CHOICE_3';
b+n
LITERAL_ED2A_9397_CHOICE_3
$choice_4 = <<'LITERAL_ED2A_9397_CHOICE_4';
b++
LITERAL_ED2A_9397_CHOICE_4
$choice_5 = <<'LITERAL_ED2A_9397_CHOICE_5';
+jn
LITERAL_ED2A_9397_CHOICE_5
$choice_6 = <<'LITERAL_ED2A_9397_CHOICE_6';
+j+
LITERAL_ED2A_9397_CHOICE_6
$choice_7 = <<'LITERAL_ED2A_9397_CHOICE_7';
++n
LITERAL_ED2A_9397_CHOICE_7
$choice_8 = <<'LITERAL_ED2A_9397_CHOICE_8';
+++
LITERAL_ED2A_9397_CHOICE_8
$correct_1 = <<'LITERAL_ED2A_9397_CORRECT_1';
b+n
LITERAL_ED2A_9397_CORRECT_1
$correct_2 = <<'LITERAL_ED2A_9397_CORRECT_2';
b++
LITERAL_ED2A_9397_CORRECT_2
$correct_3 = <<'LITERAL_ED2A_9397_CORRECT_3';
+jn
LITERAL_ED2A_9397_CORRECT_3
